 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In sixteen twenty-eight,",
   "s": 0.094,
   "e": 1.085
  },
  {
   "text": "Sweden built the mightiest warship in the world.",
   "s": 1.356,
   "e": 3.821
  },
  {
   "text": "It sank before it even left the harbor.",
   "s": 4.271,
   "e": 6.264
  },
  {
   "text": "The king wanted a monster.",
   "s": 6.714,
   "e": 7.81
  },
  {
   "text": "Sixty-four bronze cannons.",
   "s": 8.26,
   "e": 9.723
  },
  {
   "text": "Hundreds of golden carvings.",
   "s": 10.173,
   "e": 11.541
  },
  {
   "text": "Two full decks of guns.",
   "s": 11.991,
   "e": 13.099
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody argued.",
   "s": 13.549,
   "e": 14.233
  },
  {
   "text": "You don't argue with a king.",
   "s": 14.683,
   "e": 15.709
  },
  {
   "text": "So they kept stacking weight on top of a ship that was already too narrow.",
   "s": 16.159,
   "e": 19.626
  },
  {
   "text": "Before launch,",
   "s": 20.076,
   "e": 20.736
  },
  {
   "text": "they ran a test.",
   "s": 20.937,
   "e": 21.727
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty sailors ran from one side of the deck to the other.",
   "s": 22.177,
   "e": 25.125
  },
  {
   "text": "After three runs,",
   "s": 25.575,
   "e": 26.542
  },
  {
   "text": "the ship was rocking so hard,",
   "s": 26.719,
   "e": 28.287
  },
  {
   "text": "the admiral stopped the test.",
   "s": 28.57,
   "e": 29.95
  },
  {
   "text": "And then he made a bold decision.",
   "s": 30.4,
   "e": 31.709
  },
  {
   "text": "He let it sail anyway.",
   "s": 32.159,
   "e": 33.103
  },
  {
   "text": "On launch day,",
   "s": 33.553,
   "e": 34.272
  },
  {
   "text": "thousands of people lined the shore.",
   "s": 34.531,
   "e": 36.064
  },
  {
   "text": "The cannons fired a salute.",
   "s": 36.514,
   "e": 37.788
  },
  {
   "text": "The sails opened.",
   "s": 38.238,
   "e": 38.946
  },
  {
   "text": "A light breeze hit.",
   "s": 39.396,
   "e": 40.186
  },
  {
   "text": "The ship leaned,",
   "s": 40.636,
   "e": 41.261
  },
  {
   "text": "and came back.",
   "s": 41.544,
   "e": 42.251
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a second gust pushed it over,",
   "s": 42.701,
   "e": 44.352
  },
  {
   "text": "and water poured in through the open gun ports.",
   "s": 44.694,
   "e": 46.97
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty minutes.",
   "s": 47.42,
   "e": 48.069
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirteen hundred meters.",
   "s": 48.519,
   "e": 49.486
  },
  {
   "text": "That was the whole voyage.",
   "s": 49.936,
   "e": 50.997
  },
  {
   "text": "For three hundred and thirty-three years,",
   "s": 51.447,
   "e": 53.039
  },
  {
   "text": "it sat at the bottom.",
   "s": 53.275,
   "e": 54.159
  },
  {
   "text": "But the cold,",
   "s": 54.609,
   "e": 55.199
  },
  {
   "text": "dark water kept it almost perfect.",
   "s": 55.458,
   "e": 57.204
  },
  {
   "text": "Today,",
   "s": 57.654,
   "e": 57.937
  },
  {
   "text": "it's a museum,",
   "s": 58.279,
   "e": 59.01
  },
  {
   "text": "with more than a million visitors a year.",
   "s": 59.258,
   "e": 61.062
  },
  {
   "text": "The ship that never made it out of port...",
   "s": 61.512,
   "e": 63.163
  },
  {
   "text": "became Sweden's most popular trip.",
   "s": 63.613,
   "e": 65.405
  }
 ]
}